    "tool_priority_for_coordinates": {
      "value": "For finding element coordinates on screen, ALWAYS follow this priority: 1) screen_locate FIRST (it's the proper tool for finding UI element coordinates). 2) screen_process ONLY as a backup or for visual verification with verify_x/verify_y. Never use screen_process as the primary coordinate-finding tool — it gives approximate descriptions, not precise coordinates. The workflow should be: screen_locate → move cursor → screen_process with verify_x/verify_y for visual verification → click.",
